        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "In the unsettling ambiance of \"Scary Gorillas,\" a fan-made horror game set within the claustrophobic confines of a damp and ominous dirt cave, players find themselves plunged into an immersive nightmare where every rustle of gravel beneath their feet echoes like a haunting reminder of the lurking dangers, as they navigate the labyrinthine passages filled with eerie shadows and unsettling sounds, all while desperately trying to evade the grotesque gorillas that seem to materialize from the very walls of the cave, their menacing growls reverberating through the darkness, creating an ever-present sense of dread; players must also engage in a series of intricate puzzles that challenge their wit and bravery, piecing together fragments of a chilling backstory that reveals the cave’s sinister past, where unspeakable horrors once took place, forcing them to confront not only the monstrous inhabitants but also their own fears, as the atmosphere thickens with tension and the line between reality and nightmare blurs, ultimately leading to a gripping experience that leaves them questioning what lurks in the shadows and whether they will ever escape the cave’s clutches alive.",
